# Acid dissolves zinc but leaves copper
# Expectation: Equal metal doses with dilute HCl should dissolve zinc and evolve H2, while copper remains under non-oxidising conditions.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.004mol
add v1 Zn 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 HCl 0.004mol
add v2 Cu 0.001mol
inspect
